<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Teleprompter</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>Teleprompter</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>1.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>1</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
	<string>public.app-category.photography</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Para gravar o vídeo enquanto você lê o roteiro.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Para gravar a sua voz junto com o vídeo e, no modo Voz, acompanhar a leitura.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Para salvar cada take direto na sua galeria.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Para guardar os takes no álbum Teleprompter da sua galeria.</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>No modo Voz, o texto anda sozinho no ritmo da sua fala. Quando o iPhone permite, o reconhecimento roda no próprio aparelho.</string>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIColorName</key>
		<string>Fundo</string>
	</dict>
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>arm64</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIUserInterfaceStyle</key>
	<string>Dark</string>
</dict>
</plist>
